- Yeah, it's good.

00:05:30.028 --> 00:05:32.665 align:start position:0%
Well, I think we learned
a lot about Asian carp today.

00:05:32.698 --> 00:05:34.133 align:start size:16% position:84%
Yeah.

00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:35.868 align:start size:81% position:19%
